================================================================
  pk's OS @PK_VER@ - a small Linux you built yourself
  help        : pk-help            report: pk-info
  self-test   : pk-check --all     (display, audio, input, wifi, users, apps)
  apps        : pk-run ./app | pk-shell | pk-get install -y <pkg>
  desktop     : pk-desktop start   (or boot with pk_desktop=1)
  users       : pk-user add bob --admin | pk-user list
  network     : pk-net dhcp        Wi-Fi: pk-wifi connect <ssid> <pw>
  persistence : pk-persist          (keep changes on the USB stick)
  install     : pk-install         (to the internal disk)
  All changes in this live session live in RAM and are lost on reboot.
================================================================
